                                            <Button x:Name="BtnClassicMenu" Grid.Column="1" Content="🖱️ Sağ Tık Menü Aracına Git" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="32" Padding="12,0" Click="BtnClassicMenu_Click"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Border>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- ============================================================== -->
                    <!-- HUB 4: SİSTEM ONARIMI & BAKIM                                 -->
                    <!-- ============================================================== -->
                    <StackPanel x:Name="PanelHubRepair" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <!-- Category Sub-Navigation Pills -->
                        <WrapPanel Margin="0,0,0,16">
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavCleaner" Content="🧹 Akıllı Disk &amp; Log Temizliği" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" IsChecked="True" Checked="SubNavRepair_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavNetwork" Content="🌐 Ağ &amp; DNS Onarımı" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" Checked="SubNavRepair_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavDiagnostics" Content="🩺 SFC / DISM &amp; Geri Yükleme" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" Checked="SubNavRepair_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavProcesses" Content="⚡ İşlem &amp; RAM Monitörü" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" Checked="SubNavRepair_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavStartup" Content="🚀 Başlangıç Yöneticisi" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" Checked="SubNavRepair_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                        </WrapPanel>

                        <!-- Sub-View 1: Cleaner Panel -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelCleaner" Visibility="Visible">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="🧹 Sistem Temizliği &amp; Disk Önbellek Sıfırlama" FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Gereksiz sistem atıklarını, geçici dosyaları (%TEMP%), kilitli logları ve DNS önbelleğini temizler." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                        <Button Content="🧹 %TEMP% ve Kullanıcı Önbelleklerini Temizle" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnCleanTemp_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="💾 Windows Update Önbelleğini Sıfırla" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnCleanWu_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="📡 DNS Önbelleğini Sıfırla" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnFlushDns_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🗑️ Geri Dönüşüm Kutusunu Boşalt" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnEmptyRecycle_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- Sub-View 2: Network Panel -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelNetwork" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="🌐 Ağ Bağdaştırıcısı &amp; TCP/IP Yığını Onarımı" FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Ağ kopmaları, sarı ünlem ve DNS çözümleme kilitlenmelerinde TCP/IP yığınını ve Winsock kataloglarını sıfırlar." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                        <Button Content="🌐 Ağ Bağdaştırıcılarını Yeniden Başlat" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnFixNetworkAdapter_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🔌 Winsock &amp; TCP/IP Yığınını Sıfırla" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnResetWinsock_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🔄 IP Adresini Yenile (Release / Renew)" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnReleaseRenew_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="📡 DNS Önbelleğini Temizle" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnFlushDns_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- Sub-View 3: Diagnostics Panel -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelDiagnostics" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="🔧 Çekirdek Sistem Dosyası &amp; İmaj Onarımı" FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Bozulan Windows çekirdek dosyalarını, Windows Update bileşen depolarını ve dosya sistemi bütünlüğünü onarır." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                        <Button Content="🛡️ Sistem Geri Yükleme Noktası Oluştur" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnCreateRestorePoint_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🔧 SFC /scannow Dosya Doğrulaması" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRunSfc_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="💾 DISM /RestoreHealth İmaj Onarımı" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRunDism_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="📀 Chkdsk Disk Hata Taraması" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRunChkdsk_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- Sub-View 4: Processes Panel -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelProcesses" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="⚡ Çalışan İşlemler &amp; Canlı Bellek (RAM) Monitörü" FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Sistemi yoran, yanıt vermeyen işlemleri listeleyin ve tek tıkla zorla sonlandırın." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                        <Button Content="🔄 İşlem Listesini Yenile" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRefreshProcesses_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🛑 Seçili İşlemi Sonlandır (Kill Process)" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnKillSelectedProcess_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>

                                    <Border Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="6" MinHeight="200" MaxHeight="300">
                                        <DataGrid x:Name="GridProcesses" AutoGenerateColumns="False" IsReadOnly="True" Background="Transparent" 
                                                  BorderThickness="0" HeadersVisibility="Column" GridLinesVisibility="Horizontal" 
                                                  Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}">
                                            <DataGrid.Columns>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="PID" Binding="{Binding Id}" Width="80"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="İşlem Adı" Binding="{Binding Name}" Width="220"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="RAM (MB)" Binding="{Binding MemoryMB}" Width="120"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="Yanıt Durumu" Binding="{Binding Responding}" Width="120"/>
                                            </DataGrid.Columns>
                                        </DataGrid>
                                    </Border>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- Sub-View 5: Startup Panel -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelStartup" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="🚀 Windows Başlangıç Programları Yöneticisi" FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Açılışı yavaşlatan başlangıç kayıtlarını denetleyin; tek tıkla devre dışı bırakın, yeniden etkinleştirin veya sistemden tamamen silin." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                        <Button Content="🔄 Başlangıç Listesini Yenile" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRefreshStartup_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="✅ Seçileni Etkinleştir" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnEnableStartupItem_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🛑 Seçileni Devre Dışı Bırak" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnDisableStartupItem_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="🗑️ Sistemden Kaldır" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,10" Click="BtnRemoveStartupItem_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>

                                    <Border Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="6" MinHeight="220" MaxHeight="320">
                                        <DataGrid x:Name="GridStartup" AutoGenerateColumns="False" IsReadOnly="True" Background="Transparent" 
                                                  BorderThickness="0" HeadersVisibility="Column" GridLinesVisibility="Horizontal" 
                                                  Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}">
                                            <DataGrid.Columns>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="Durum" Binding="{Binding Status}" Width="120" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="Kayıt Adı" Binding="{Binding Name}" Width="180"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="Komut / Dosya Yolu" Binding="{Binding Command}" Width="360"/>
                                                <DataGridTextColumn Header="Konum / Kovan" Binding="{Binding Location}" Width="160"/>
                                            </DataGrid.Columns>
                                        </DataGrid>
                                    </Border>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- ============================================================== -->
                    <!-- HUB 5: YAPAY ZEKÂ TEŞHİS & WEB ÇÖZÜM                          -->
                    <!-- ============================================================== -->
                    <StackPanel x:Name="PanelHubAI" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <!-- Category Sub-Navigation Pills -->
                        <WrapPanel Margin="0,0,0,16">
                            <RadioButton x:Name="SubNavAiAssistant" Content="🤖 AI Arıza Asistanı &amp; Onaylı Çözümler" Style="{StaticResource FluentSubNavPill}" IsChecked="True" Checked="SubNavAI_Checked" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
                        </WrapPanel>

                        <!-- PanelAI: 2 Satırlık Giriş Kutusu + Onay Rozetli Çözüm Kartı -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="PanelAI" Visibility="Visible">
                            <!-- Arıza Arama ve Soru Formu -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                                            <TextBlock Text="🤖 BT Yapay Zekâ Teşhis &amp; Çok Katmanlı Kaynak Motoru" FontSize="17" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="İlk olarak Resmi Microsoft kaynaklarını (learn.microsoft.com, support.microsoft.com), ardından saygın teknoloji forumlarını (SuperUser, ElevenForum vb.) tarayarak onaylı PowerShell ve CMD çözümleri üretir." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,3,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="{DynamicResource BrushAccent}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="10,4" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="Microsoft Docs + Forumlar" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#000000"/>
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <TextBlock Text="🔍 ARIZA AÇIKLAMASI VEYA HATA KODU GİRİNİZ (2 SATIR DESTEKLİ):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" Margin="0,10,0,6"/>

                                    <!-- 2-Line Input Box & Big Analyze Button -->
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="10" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        
                                        <!-- 2-Satır Genişletilebilir Arama Kutusu -->
                                        <TextBox x:Name="TxtAiIssueQuery" Grid.Column="0" MinHeight="64" FontSize="13.5"
                                                 AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                 Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" 
                                                 BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" Padding="12,8" VerticalContentAlignment="Top" 
                                                 KeyDown="TxtAiIssueQuery_KeyDown"
                                                 ToolTip="Örn: 0x0000011b, ekran kartı kilitlendi, mavi ekran nvlddmkm.sys, internet yok, regedit engellendi"/>
                                        
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnAiAnalyze" Grid.Column="2" Content="⚡ Yapay Zekâ &amp; Web Analizi" 
                                                Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="64" Padding="20,0" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="Bold"
                                                Click="BtnAiAnalyze_Click"/>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- Hızlı Örnek Çipleri -->
                                    <WrapPanel Margin="0,2,0,0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Hızlı Örnekler:" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,8,4"/>
                                        <Button Content="0x0000011b Yazıcı RPC" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="Ekran Kartı Kilitlendi (nvlddmkm)" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="Dosya Uzantıları Görünmüyor" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="Ağ Kartı Tanınmıyor &amp; Sürücü" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="Grup İlkesi (GPO) Engellendi" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="0x80070005 Erişim Engellendi" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="DNS &amp; Ağ Yığını Sıfırlama" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Padding="8,4" FontSize="11" Margin="0,0,6,4" Click="BtnAiPreset_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- Çözüm & Onarım Sonuç Kartı (Dinamik - Onay Rozeti ile) -->
                            <Border x:Name="CardAiSolution" Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16" Visibility="Collapsed" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushAccent}" BorderThickness="1.5">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiSolutionTitle" Text="Arıza Teşhis Başlığı" FontSize="17" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushAccent}"/>
                                            <WrapPanel Margin="0,3,0,0">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiCategoryText" Text="Kategori: Windows Çekirdeği" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiSourceTier" Text="Kaynak: Resmi Microsoft Belgesi" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#38BDF8" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            </WrapPanel>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <!-- Onaylı Çözüm Rozeti (Kullanıcı Talebi: Onay İşaretli Rozet) -->
                                            <Border x:Name="BadgeAiVerified" Background="#059669" CornerRadius="4" Padding="10,4" Margin="0,0,8,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiVerifiedBadge" Text="✅ ONAYLI RESMİ ÇÖZÜM" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="White"/>
                                            </Border>
                                            
                                            <Border x:Name="BadgeAiSeverity" Background="#EF4444" CornerRadius="4" Padding="10,4">
                                                <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiSeverity" Text="Kritik" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="White"/>
                                            </Border>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- Kök Neden -->
                                    <Border Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="6" Padding="12" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="🔬 TESPİT EDİLEN KÖK NEDEN:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiRootCause" Text="Kök neden tespiti yükleniyor..." FontSize="13" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="18"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <!-- Web İçgörüsü -->
                                    <Border x:Name="PanelAiWebInsights" Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" BorderBrush="#0284C7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="6" Padding="12" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="Collapsed">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="🌐 CANLI WEB &amp; TOPLULUK VERİTABANI İÇGÖRÜSÜ:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#38BDF8" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiWebInsights" Text="Web içgörüsü bulunamadı." FontSize="12.5" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="18"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <!-- Adım Adım Rehber -->
                                    <TextBlock Text="📋 TAVSİYE EDİLEN ONARIM ADIMLARI:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="TxtAiSteps" Text="1. Adım..." FontSize="12.5" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="20" Margin="0,0,0,14"/>

                                    <!-- Kod & Script Bloğu -->
                                    <TextBlock Text="⚡ OTOMATİK ONARIM POWERSHELL / CMD SCRİPTİ:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBox x:Name="TxtAiAutoFixScript" Height="130" IsReadOnly="True" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                             FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12" Background="#0F172A" Foreground="#34D399" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}"
                                             Padding="10" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnRunAiScript" Content="⚡ Bu Onarım Scriptini Çalıştır (PowerShell)" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="34" Padding="14,0" Margin="0,0,10,6" Click="BtnRunAiScript_Click"/>
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnCopyAiScript" Content="📋 Komutu Kopyala" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="34" Padding="12,0" Margin="0,0,10,6" Click="BtnCopyAiScript_Click"/>
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnSaveAiScript" Content="💾 Script Olarak Kaydet (.ps1)" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="34" Padding="12,0" Margin="0,0,10,6" Click="BtnSaveAiScript_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- Sistem Olay ve BSOD Analizi -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentCard}" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="💥 Windows Olay Günlüğü &amp; BSOD Minidump Taraması" FontSize="15" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Sistemdeki son kritik hata kayıtlarını ve minidump dökümlerini tarayarak çökmeye yol açan sürücüyü listeleyin." FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,0,0,14"/>

                                    <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <Button Content="🤖 Sistem Sağlık &amp; Olay Günlüğü Taraması" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,6" Click="BtnAiEventScan_Click"/>
                                        <Button Content="💥 Mavi Ekran (BSOD) Minidump Analizi" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,6" Click="BtnAiBsodScan_Click"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>

                </Grid>
            </ScrollViewer>

            <!-- Bottom Live Output Console -->
            <Border Grid.Row="2" Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgSidebar}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="20,12">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Text="📋 CANLI KONSOL ÇIKTISI &amp; LOG TERMİNALİ" FontSize="11" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextMuted}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <Button Grid.Column="1" Content="Temizle" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Height="26" Padding="10,0" Click="BtnClearLog_Click"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <TextBox x:Name="TxtConsoleLog" Grid.Row="1" Background="Transparent" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushAccent}" 
                             BorderThickness="0" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11.5" IsReadOnly="True" 
                             VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </Grid>

        <!-- In-App Modal Dialog Overlay (Popup Pencere) -->
        <Grid x:Name="ModalOverlay" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Background="#A0000000" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource FluentModalCard}" Width="780" MaxHeight="620" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <!-- Modal Header -->
                    <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtModalTitle" Text="Detaylı Rapor &amp; Çıktı" FontSize="17" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="TxtModalSubtitle" Text="Modül içi anlık önizleme penceresi" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextSecondary}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Button Grid.Column="1" Content="✕" Style="{StaticResource FluentSidebarToggleBtn}" Width="30" Height="30" FontSize="14" Click="BtnCloseModal_Click" ToolTip="Kapat"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- Modal Content Area -->
                    <Border Grid.Row="1" Background="{DynamicResource BrushBgWindow}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BrushBorder}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                        <TextBox x:Name="TxtModalContent" Background="Transparent" Foreground="{DynamicResource BrushTextPrimary}" 
                                 BorderThickness="0" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12" IsReadOnly="True" 
                                 VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                    </Border>

                    <!-- Modal Footer Actions -->
                    <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                        <Button x:Name="BtnModalCopy" Content="📋 Panoya Kopyala" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,0" Click="BtnModalCopy_Click"/>
                        <Button x:Name="BtnModalSave" Content="💾 Dosyaya Kaydet" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Margin="0,0,10,0" Click="BtnModalSave_Click"/>
                        <Button Content="Kapat" Style="{StaticResource FluentButton}" Click="BtnCloseModal_Click"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</Window>
